WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.180
Small wins, big losses? Your brain is tricking you.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.350
The disposition effect: taking profits too early, holding losers too long.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.580
One: losses hurt about twice as much as gains feel good.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:18.780
Two: six winners – and still three hundred dollars down.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.980
Three: set your target first, then hands off.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.980
Common mistake: the safe little profit.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.580
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:36.030
I show trades managed by plan live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
